{"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:40:20.561Z","ordinal":46,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_02c235f180903e66016ad7c3a025d481918c36ee899b2aa939","status":"completed","call_id":"call_2a474f95425d4b6f8fefbbfed61fcbd3","name":"exec","input":"text(await tools.mcp__coding__write_file({name:\"primary-publication.md\",content:\"Run primary-publication.js with input {\\\"entry_id\\\":\\\"1UBQ\\\"} or another four-character PDB identifier. Performs credential-free GET reads only on data.rcsb.org/graphql and api.crossref.org/works/{doi}. RCSB rcsb_primary_citation and id=primary establish the primary publication association; Crossref must return the same DOI as a journal-article (not dataset). Checks title, publication year, volume and page range. Title comparison uses Unicode NFKD with combining marks removed, accommodating RCSB A versus Crossref Å; output preserves the exact Crossref title array. Throws on missing identifiers or failed checks. Verified by execution for 1UBQ: DOI 10.1016/0022-2836(87)90679-6; title [\\\"Structure of ubiquitin refined at 1.8 Å resolution\\\"]; publisher Elsevier BV. Both sources agree on 1987, volume 194, pages 531-544. Saved implementation was executed successfully after repair of Unicode title normalization. Earlier saved documentation records verification for 1CRN and 2LYZ.\"}));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a15ad3-b809-7772-83d1-867fc8cb1961","create_time":1792525216.1590745}}}
